<title>Ethiopia: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/ethiopia/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-ethiopia-2026-10-12T07:34:09.383Z</guid>
<pubDate>Mon, 12 Oct 2026 07:34:09 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Ethiopian drones have struck Eritrean forces that were supporting Tigrayan rebels, while Eritrean troops have crossed into Ethiopian territory, prompting both sides to ask the UN for deterrence or intervention. Fighting now extends across Tigray, Amhara and the border area, with Ethiopia warning Eritrea it will defend against incursions. The UN chief has expressed grave concern about the renewed fighting in northern Ethiopia. The conflict caused 2,824 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixAFBVV95cUxOa3otdUpMV081a0ZSLTRCeHRwM2ZRV05qYi1nUHgtSHpjMnVPU2FXUV9jZ0JCYjFsTC1xN2lBUzNGTE9JeFNUMmlpV01pcnNkejk2TFdSMkp2WURRRWhNZloyRVRaTEYzamRTNXUwTV80ZkhoUE9OR1gwYWJVMUpwemhuMkVZT2dYLVF5NVUwSnJWNngtRFhJcDFHWkxjNmlDSDZEUlJ4R0hSQTBtN2JXb2s3MmUyaFBMSlJmNHc1WGdJVXEt?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivgFBVV95cUxOQnBha3VpVVVrYTg2Wi1WLVJUQjRPNzNyaG1EYklBZFZuQ1A2T0hxRDFTMWJycnZjVm0zc2Q3dXR1OVBHdWh3elVBMHhxLS14RU9fcVJ4WkdqUGVZd05iVHJYU3BpcmRnbTlRdkZkcXpKX2pYZ0hIS00yOG0yMl9LaXBTSjVnaG9LQmhmTGp3dVRfbXFFQ1RtTTQ2NS10b3c5WkdwRmFHcklDdmxOSlNkT3hYS0dRRGZBM0JpWWtB0gG-AUFVX3lxTE9XT2JMLVBaekkxTy1OQ0w4R2d0bnk4SF85RlBwNDMzSE1BN1M5TmZaUVRsSFJsaE1BYjBmTnZ1TVRieUVPbVZIYmRNbHZzbmRsVXJ2cExLUVBxV2p4cnB0a3BJUHctbVc5bWJHRUQ1ZWgyNGFmZ0tCMGs2eUZhbWhwd2FtVWVnV2ZwbDhEcjRTRGlGWDZBMTBwRWtwTFBxNVd4Y3NzdS1pUGdfcE80b0lNb2hKVFFMXzFRVHdpN2c?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixAFBVV95cUxPTnphMnl